/span>:\t\t\tThank you, Chef. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Chef Bruce</span>:\t\tYou can call me Bruce. We're a big family here. You don't have to be too formal.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tWhere I worked before coming to the States, we were supposed to address everyone with respect. It is not polite to call your superiors by name. People hold on to \u2026 what's the word?\t\t<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Chef Bruce</span>:\t\tDecorum? That's when everything is supposed to be done according to the rules. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tThat's a good word. It describes some of the cultural differences I have noticed so far.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn8le05ob10re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Chef Bruce</span>:\t\tWhat else have you noticed?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tAs I explained to Vanessa, people take lunch very seriously back home. We all sit down with our families and enjoy our meal. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Chef Bruce</span>:\t\tI wish it was the same here. Appreciating a good meal is definitely something we should pass on to the future generations.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tI agree. I've also noticed that people don't mind dressing down for work or for going out.", "time": "33000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn8le05ob10re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Chef Bruce</span>:\t\tOh yeah? It's not the same in Colombia?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tNot at all! You're supposed to wear something nice if you're going to be seen in public. Men and women should always be well-dressed.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Chef Bruce</span>:\t\tAll the time?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tYes, even when we go dancing. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Chef Bruce</span>:\t\tI heard that you love dancing in Colombia. Maybe you should teach me some steps.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tI would love to.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Chef Bruce</span>: \t\tI'm warning you, though: I have two left feet.", "time": "57000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}